    "body": "Claim released. STOPPED because PR #2149 changes SetOperationGeometry::new in crates/app/src/commands/operation/geometry.rs and collect_job in crates/app/src/operation/job.rs. The Probe fix needs these functions to resolve picks in the operation setup, including when another setup is active or the alignment changes. PR #2149 is already stacked on #2077. The worker instructions allow only one stacking level. PR #2134 also changes these functions and is already stacked on #2106. No production code changed and no branch was pushed. A draft pin was written before these additional overlaps were found. The issue remains open for work after the overlap clears.\n",
